{"format":"beef-gui-model","version":1,"name":"Bergsøysund floating bridge (truss)","description":"Steel truss on 7 pontoons, from the Abaqus model used in the WAWI examples: 1210 nodes, 2924 elements, pontoon mass/added mass/hydrostatic matrices, equivalent deck. Modal analysis (sparse solver). First 30 frequencies within -7 %/+3.5 % of Abaqus.","notes":"Truss part of the Abaqus model of the Bergsoysund floating bridge (BSB_basemodel_j.inp) used in the WAWI examples. B32 beams reduced to 2-node beams between joints; Abaqus ties as node-to-node constraints; pontoon rigid bodies as stiff links; rod bearings fixed; pontoon mass + zero-frequency added mass + hydrostatic stiffness and the rotated nose springs as CustomMatrix features. The 8 mm trough-stiffened shell deck is an equivalent lattice: edge/centre lines (1/6, 4/6, 1/6 split) carrying deck mass, axial area and vertical bending, and X-braces with the in-plane shear stiffness of the plate; stiff links for the 50 mm end plates. First 30 natural frequencies within -7 % to +3.5 % of the Abaqus dry modes (26 of 30 within 3 %).","domain":"3d","nodes":[{"label":1,"x":396.07602,"y":1232.31299,"z":7.0},{"label":2,"x":399.50311,"y":1242.97571,"z":7.0},{"label":3,"x":387.73605,"y":1234.9624,"z":7.0},{"label":4,"x":391.091,"y":1245.64807,"z":7.0},{"label":5,"x":379.37836,"y":1237.55542,"z":7.0},{"label":6,"x":382.66098,"y":1248.26355,"z":7.0},{"label":7,"x":371.00333,"y":1240.09192,"z":7.0},{"label":8,"x":374.2135,"y":1250.82202,"z":7.0},{"label":9,"x":362.61136,"y":1242.57166,"z":7.0},{"label":10,"x":365.7489,"y":1253.32324,"z":7.0},{"label":11,"x":354.20282,"y":1244.99463,"z":7.0},{"label":12,"x":357.26761,"y":1255.76721,"z":7.0},{"label":13,"x":345.77808,"y":1247.36072,"z":7.0},{"label":14,"x":348.76996,"y":1258.15381,"z":7.0},{"label":15,"x":337.33752,"y":1249.6698,"z":7.0},{"label":16,"x":340.25638,"y":1260.48279,"z":7.0},{"label":17,"x":328.88156,"y":1251.92188,"z":7.0},{"label":18,"x":331.72726,"y":1262.75427,"z":7.